cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "A Hybrid ARIMA-LSTM Framework for Retail Sales Forecasting with Business Intelligence Integration"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Negahbani
    given-names: Farid
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code, tests and documentation of an M.Sc. Data Science project (Arden University, COM7014 - Advanced
  Computing Project) that benchmarks seasonal naive, ARIMA, ETS, feed-forward, LSTM and three hybrid
  ARIMA-LSTM residual models on store-level daily sales from the M5 and Rossmann
  Kaggle datasets, with rolling-origin evaluation, Diebold-Mariano tests, conformal
  prediction intervals and a Power BI data model.
keywords:
  - time-series forecasting
  - ARIMA
  - LSTM
  - hybrid models
  - retail analytics
  - business intelligence
